{
  "name": "Bloodweaver",
  "slug": "bloodweaver",
  "class": "Dragoneer",
  "subclass_feature": "Core Concept",
  "summary": "TBA",
  "introduction": [
    "Emulating the power of a dragon’s blood—considered by many to be the most magical substance native to organic life—the bloodweaver draws out the pure energy in their magic and infuses it into their body or their strikes. Each spell that flows through them heals their wounds and refreshes them, and being so closely tied to a dragon’s nature means that they can manifest their dragon spirit to assault others with a phantom of a dragon."
  ],
